                            <p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #8A94A6; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;">A quick walkthrough of the admin console</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" id="closeTutorial"
